\b MacDown Next\par
\b0 A fork of MacDown that carries on where it left off: the editor draws the Markdown instead of showing its punctuation, the two panes follow one another, tables are edited by command, and the Word and EPUB exports arrive with their structure and their pictures intact.\par
\par
