\par
\b Standing on\par
\b0 Hoedown for the Markdown, peg-markdown-highlight for the editor's colours, Prism for the code, MathJax for the formulas, mermaid and Graphviz for the diagrams, libyaml for the front matter. The full text of every licence is in the LICENSE directory of the repository.\par
